  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_ligula_cbd2f36ebee1d0ea5f5caf6524301239f9fd9436940ccab07ff077808d8fddecb9">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Strips of flexible material, especially leather, used for fastening or holding things together. May have a buckle or other fastener attached. For strips that pass over the shoulder, use "shoulder straps (object components)." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
